#: c-api/index.rst:7
msgid ""
"This manual documents the API used by C and C++ programmers who want to "
"write extension modules or embed Python.  It is a companion "
"to :ref:`extending-index`, which describes the general principles of "
"extension writing but does not document the API functions in detail."
